```

Hmm, that upstream code has `err` declared... our version differs (no logging, no err var). The HDFS-16563 change introduced the err/log version. Our tree predates HDFS-16563.

Decision: To satisfy the acceptance signals ("message should clearly state that the token has expired"), I should make the InvalidToken message read "Token <realUser> has expired, current time: ... expected renewal time: ...". Apply the upstream post-YARN-11172 text adapted to our structure:

